<h1>About CSBFP</h1>
<div class="about-intro">
<p>Certified Small Business Finance Professional (CSBFP) is a professional certification for individuals working in small business finance. It is independently administered to ensure applicants are evaluated fairly and consistently.</p>
<p>CSBFP was created to establish a common standard of foundational knowledge across the industry. The program covers how the commercial finance industry operates, financing products, applicable regulations, and standards of professional conduct.</p>
<p>The program aims to recognize individuals who demonstrate this knowledge and support better experiences for small business owners seeking financing.</p>
</div>

<h2>How it works</h2>
<ol class="numbered">
  <li>Create an account and complete your application.</li>
  <li>Accept the professional standards.</li>
  <li>Complete four short training modules.</li>
  <li>Pass a 20-question assessment.</li>
  <li>Pay the <%= program.annualFee %> annual certification fee.</li>
  <li>Complete a one-time background screening.</li>
  <li>Receive your certification number upon approval.</li>
</ol>

<div class="actions">
  <a class="button" href="/portal/signup">Get Certified</a>
